OL,3,GNEWSAHousing committee proposes
OL,4,Afirst-time buyer scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey's housing committee is
OL,7,Fconsidering a range of proposals to
OL,8,Fsupport first-time buyers.
OL,10,FThe proposals include an individual
OL,11,Fsavings account (ISA) style savings
OL,12,Fscheme, reduced document duty and
OL,13,Fselling a selection of properties built
OL,14,Fon affordable housing sites at about
OL,15,F75% of market value.
OL,17,FThe committee highlighted the proposals
OL,18,Fin its Work Plan. The proposals would
OL,19,Frequire States' approval before they
OL,20,Fcan be applied.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
