OL,3,GNEWSAHousing committee proposes
OL,4,Afirst-time buyer scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FEstate agents said first-time buyers
OL,7,Ffaced a variety of barriers, including
OL,8,Finitial purchase costs, getting a
OL,9,Fdeposit together and home
OL,10,Faffordability.
